### Start the app first with the local profile:
### ./gradlew bootRun --args='--spring.profiles.active=local'

### Book 2 seats: 201 with the booking
POST http://localhost:8085/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 2}

### Not enough seats: 409 with availableSeats
POST http://localhost:8085/events/jazz-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 500}

### Unknown event: 404
POST http://localhost:8085/events/nope/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 2}

### Zero seats: 400, the office is never called
POST http://localhost:8085/events/rock-cluj/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerEmail": "ana@mail.ro", "seats": 0}

### Read one booking (stretch 2): copy the id from the 201 above
GET http://localhost:8085/events/rock-cluj/bookings/PASTE-THE-BOOKING-ID
